## 7. Quick Revision Table

| CSS Property | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `justify-content` | Distributes flex items along the main axis |
| `align-items` | Aligns items along the cross axis |
| `color` | Changes text color |
| `font-family` | Changes the font |
| `text-align` | Aligns text |
| `text-indent` | Indents the first line |
| `text-transform` | Changes text capitalization |
| `list-style-type` | Changes list markers |
| `list-style-position` | Controls marker position |
| `inherit` | Takes the parent's computed property value |

